<node id="Triptan">
  <data key="d0">Triptan</data>
  <data key="d1">medication</data>
  <data key="d2">Triptan은 편두통 치료에 사용되는 약물군이다.&lt;SEP&gt;Triptan is a medication that causes vasoconstriction of dilated blood vessels and inhibits the release of CGRP, leading to reduced inflammation and nerve activation.</data>
