  <data key="d0">CGRP</data>
  <data key="d1">peptide</data>
  <data key="d2">CGRP는 편두통과 관련된 신경 펩타이드로, 편두통 발달에 중요한 역할을 한다.&lt;SEP&gt;CGRP, or Calcitonin Gene-Related Peptide, is a neuropeptide involved in the transmission of pain and is associated with migraine.</data>
